  "nodes": [
    {
      "post_id": "544425492971941888",
      "text": "I love #illridewithyou. That says #Sydney.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:35:27 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": null,
      "post_type": "source"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544429366638161920",
      "text": "@murdochsj @JezNews I question its practicality. But really, it's a gesture, reminding people someone else on the bus might have their back.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:50:50 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.44428839531606e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544428839531606016",
      "text": "@mrbenjaminlaw @JezNews you have to catch the bus with someone? Honestly. I am, though, watching from afar.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:48:45 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4442837557866906e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544431214719799298",
      "text": "@murdochsj @SusanCarland @JezNews Strapping, impressively tall men like yourself might not be the target audience, Scotty!",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:58:11 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444307719145554e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544426272051318784",
      "text": "@joshgnosis Thanks, Josh. Much appreciated.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:38:32 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444261759136645e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544428213280059393",
      "text": "@murdochsj @JezNews I get that some are finding it patronising or lame, but I prefer this to the alternative that's been on Twitter all day.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:46:15 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4442767900542566e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544431010327166977",
      "text": "@mrbenjaminlaw @JezNews @murdochsj it's a gesture of goodwill",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:57:22 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444293666381619e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544440814017867776",
      "text": "@murdochsj @SusanCarland @JezNews @mrbenjaminlaw a white male journo at The Australian not understanding racism? Well colour me surprised!",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 10:36:19 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444307719145554e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544429638877859840",
      "text": "@mrbenjaminlaw @murdochsj Ben's right. It won't change the world. But it's an important expression to the vulnerable, and those who feel so",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:51:55 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444293666381619e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544431712684769280",
      "text": "@julesaly *huuuuugs*",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 10:00:10 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444306180804444e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544430136943075330",
      "text": "@JezNews @mrbenjaminlaw @murdochsj As a woman in hijab, let me tell you: you have no idea how vulnerable you can feel on pub transp.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:53:54 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4442963887785984e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544426448979652609",
      "text": "@joshgnosis @JezNews As always 😄 Much #Respect for Jez. Top notch Journo !",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:39:15 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444261759136645e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544451248288587776",
      "text": "@edenland very true, but I read you Woogs, Carly Findlay and Sawhole each day for a little piece of home.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 11:17:47 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444499046516941e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544462302435504128",
      "text": "@mrbenjaminlaw @murdochsj @JezNews not lame. Humankind. Being both. I dig it xx",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 12:01:43 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444282132800594e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544446571014660096",
      "text": "@murdochsj @SusanCarland @JezNews @mrbenjaminlaw So it's better to do/say nothing? No, I'll take a hashtag over silence any day.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 10:59:12 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444307719145554e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544430771914555393",
      "text": "@SusanCarland @JezNews @mrbenjaminlaw yes and it's completely vile that it happens. But I don't think online campaign hits the right note.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:56:25 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444301369430753e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544428907177340928",
      "text": "@SasBattine Thank you!",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:49:01 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4442861696086426e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544452116798910464",
      "text": "@murdochsj Mate. I've been attacked tonight, I'm sensitive. And I just got back from Uganda and saw it all for myself so also defensive.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 11:21:14 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444512482885878e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544431791222693888",
      "text": "@PatsKarvelas @murdochsj @SusanCarland @JezNews http://t.co/NukFaGEJf9",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 10:00:28 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444315511113769e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544434090204999682",
      "text": "@mrbenjaminlaw @murdochsj @JezNews Scott's the one in the middle, right?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 10:09:36 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.44431584456106e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544430580880773120",
      "text": "@murdochsj @mrbenjaminlaw @JezNews If it compels even one person to defend standards of decency, it's a victory. Every action has an impact.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:55:40 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.44428320171905e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544433083038957568",
      "text": "@mrbenjaminlaw that is true friendship.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 10:05:36 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4443273492433306e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544432734924333056",
      "text": "@SusanCarland @JezNews @murdochsj #illridewithyou, Susan. Might not have the biceps, but I can buy a flamethrower. x",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 10:04:13 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4443021132486246e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544426175913664512",
      "text": "@JezNews your coverage has been top notch, too.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:38:09 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444254929719419e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544429647622975489",
      "text": "@murdochsj @JezNews It's easy to log off, mate.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:51:57 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4442903188238336e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544460872785997824",
      "text": "@murdochsj Thanks. You too x",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 11:56:02 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444525439426396e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544427187269427200",
      "text": "@JezNews is that not hugely lame?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:42:11 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444254929719419e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544429164753743872",
      "text": "@mrbenjaminlaw @JezNews @murdochsj This is not lame, this is the Australia that we love - caring, compassionate, kind.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:50:02 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444282132800594e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544452543942639618",
      "text": "@edenland I understand, hope you're ok, Eden.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 11:22:56 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4445211679891046e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544429931027902464",
      "text": "@mrbenjaminlaw log off, mate?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:53:05 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444296476229755e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544426838097797120",
      "text": "@JezNews Np. My pleasure",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:40:47 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4442672372751974e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544427679005425664",
      "text": "@murdochsj @JezNews I've been attacked on public transport; Jez has too. It's a gesture, but if you're feeling vulnerable, an affirming one.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:44:08 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444271872694272e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544430001060200448",
      "text": "@murdochsj @JezNews P.S. Last tweet not meant to be unkind. There are days Twitter shits me too.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:53:21 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444296476229755e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544428616960864256",
      "text": "@JezNews Great coverage today in stressful circumstances, well done you.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:47:51 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444254929719419e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544429031882383361",
      "text": "@mrbenjaminlaw @JezNews the twitter echo chamber is in full force today. More so than I have seen in recent times.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:49:30 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4442837557866906e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544425699449114624",
      "text": "@JezNews You were amazing today. Thanks Jez!",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:36:16 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444254929719419e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544431008175501312",
      "text": "@chrisxjervis @mrbenjaminlaw @JezNews should that not happen every day though?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:57:22 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444305808807731e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544428375578669056",
      "text": "@murdochsj @JezNews How so?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:46:54 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.44428320171905e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544429451967070208",
      "text": "@murdochsj @JezNews Because really, that's the worst thing when you're singled out: feeling no one else on the train/bus/tram gives a shit.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:51:11 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.44428839531606e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544435110578122752",
      "text": "@murdochsj seriously? ur sayin its a good idea, just not today? Lots of good things come late, relax @SusanCarland @JezNews @mrbenjaminlaw",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 10:13:40 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444307719145554e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544426723727519744",
      "text": "@AussiemacJ Thanks, mate",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:40:20 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444264489796526e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544425801085493248",
      "text": "@SawHole Thank you!",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:36:40 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444256994491146e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544449330560503808",
      "text": "@edenland @SusanCarland @JezNews @mrbenjaminlaw no I'm not Eden. I read every word you write and I'm sorry you feel that way.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 11:10:10 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444489552961454e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544428418343788545",
      "text": "@mrbenjaminlaw @murdochsj My sentiments, exactly.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:47:04 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444282132800594e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544448955296145409",
      "text": "@murdochsj @SusanCarland @JezNews @mrbenjaminlaw You're being deliberately antagonist tonight Scott. About everything.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 11:08:40 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444307719145554e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544437656428367872",
      "text": "@mrbenjaminlaw @SusanCarland @JezNews @murdochsj I'm a pacifist but I'd happily punch a ranting bigot in the face to protect the innocent.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 10:23:47 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4443273492433306e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544429434191630336",
      "text": "@murdochsj @mrbenjaminlaw @JezNews I disagree. I think it's meant as a comfort and a gesture of goodwill. That's positive and constructive.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:51:06 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.44428320171905e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544430618080444416",
      "text": "@mrbenjaminlaw @murdochsj @JezNews I think you all need to have a big internet group hug. Tough day",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:55:49 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4443000106020045e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544428986646818816",
      "text": "@mrbenjaminlaw Thanks, mate. Much appreciated.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:49:20 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4442865614403994e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544430211324862464",
      "text": "@JezNews @mrbenjaminlaw @murdochsj knowing that at least some ppl are aware of that and want to help? It means a lot.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:54:12 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4442963887785984e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544435048959590400",
      "text": "@mrbenjaminlaw @julesaly @JezNews I'm cool with that",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 10:13:25 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444345704691835e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544428656144039938",
      "text": "@JezNews P.S. Great job today, by the way. Must've been frickin' exhausting, but you were a pro.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:48:01 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4442841834378854e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544430273471848448",
      "text": "@JezNews @mrbenjaminlaw Print up this practical sign, stick on iPad or book when travelling #illridewithyou http://t.co/MdO7iixD8A",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:54:26 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4442963887785984e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544449904651694080",
      "text": "@murdochsj @SusanCarland @JezNews @mrbenjaminlaw I think it's a shitty twitter night all round, really. Hard day for lots.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 11:12:27 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444493305605038e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544431551111376896",
      "text": "@mrbenjaminlaw @murdochsj @SusanCarland @JezNews Ben is cracking me up xxx",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:59:31 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444312147197993e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544434570469183490",
      "text": "@julesaly @murdochsj @JezNews Scott's Claire Danes in every role play scenario.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 10:11:31 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444340902049997e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544450194792665088",
      "text": "@SusanCarland @JaneCaro @JezNews @mrbenjaminlaw @murdochsj the world will be good once ppl realise one does not equal all - stay safe",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 11:13:36 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444301369430753e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544431584456105984",
      "text": "@julesaly @murdochsj @JezNews http://t.co/hRL8JAB7Vp",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:59:39 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444306180804444e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544430097168470016",
      "text": "@SaraIrvine @JezNews @murdochsj @mrbenjaminlaw Nonsense to help and comfort people?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:53:44 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4442943419163034e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544428320171905024",
